1	/**
2	 * TEMPORARY, THROWAWAY DEMO — not intended to merge. See the PR this ships on for context: it
3	 * exists purely to show the shared ZimmProductCard component family (PR #85) live, against real
4	 * SFCC product data, from the homepage, via this repo's ephemeral MRT preview environment.
5	 *
6	 * Renders all 11 states ZimmProductCard's own Storybook story set already covers
7	 * (organisms/zimmProductCard/index.stories.tsx), reusing ONE real fetched product's data as the
8	 * shared base and overriding only the specific prop(s) each state needs — the same
9	 * `{...Default.args, <override>}` pattern that story file already uses, just with a real product
10	 * substituted for its hand-authored SVG fixture. Add-to-bag is fully real (the same
11	 * `addItemToNewOrExistingBasket` mutation the PDP uses); `onNotifyMe`/`onRemove` are demo-only
12	 * toasts, since no such mutation exists anywhere in this codebase to wire them to for real.
13	 *
14	 * Known, un-fixed gap: `ZimmProductCardContent`'s bag button has no loading-spinner slot at all
15	 * (only `isUnavailable` exists as a lever) — a slow add-to-bag request shows no in-button pending
16	 * state. Not fixed here; that would be scope creep onto a broadly-consumed shared component for a
17	 * throwaway demo page.
18	 */
