  // on the image itself (should navigate) from a click on the arrow/remove buttons nested inside
  // the same now-lifted region (must keep doing only their own thing, never also navigate). Real
  // navigation isn't observable here (see file header) — what's tested instead is the guard's
  // actual, real-browser discriminating behaviour: paging state changes only for a button click,
  // never for a plain image click.

